# CODEOWNERS for Tomcat-RS Compatibility Runtime.
#
# GitHub uses this file to request reviews automatically when a PR touches
# a path that matches one of the patterns below. The last matching pattern
# wins for any given file.
#
# The owner across the board is the project maintainer; specific
# security-load-bearing crates and top-level governance files are listed
# explicitly so they cannot fall through to a more permissive default.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                                       @nktkt

# Top-level policy / governance files.
/README.md                              @nktkt
/SECURITY.md                            @nktkt
/CHANGELOG.md                           @nktkt
/CONTRIBUTING.md                        @nktkt
/LICENSE                                @nktkt
/NOTICE                                 @nktkt
/ROADMAP.md                             @nktkt

# CI, supply-chain, and Dependabot configuration.
/.github/                               @nktkt
/.github/workflows/                     @nktkt
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @nktkt
/deny.toml                              @nktkt
/.cargo/audit.toml                      @nktkt

# Security-load-bearing crates. Every change here should be eyes-on.
/crates/tomcatrs-security/              @nktkt
/crates/tomcatrs-servlet-bridge/        @nktkt
